## HATCI vehicle data

`configs/tmp_26s_demo.yaml` is a configuration file, but most of the numbers in
it are measurements of a Hyundai America Technical Center vehicle, supplied by
HATCI or derived from recordings they provided. They are not ours to licence.

- Vehicle geometry read from the bags' own `/vehicle_config`: wheelbase
  2.815 m, maximum road wheel angle 32 degrees, camera 1.07 m ahead of the
  rear axle.
- Camera intrinsics from the bags' own `CameraInfo`: 2880x1860, fx 1714.2,
  from which the 80.1 degree horizontal field of view is computed.
- Speeds and lateral acceleration limits derived from CAN recorded on that
  vehicle, including the per-bag median, p85, p95 and maximum figures in the
  file's comments.
- The hood mask polygon, traced from footage recorded by that vehicle's
  camera.

## Not in this repository

Shipped separately or not at all, and listed here because the repository
documents them:

- The model weights and TensorRT engines, 395 MB. The engines are serialised
  against one exact TensorRT build.
- The demo clips, 868 MB. Footage recorded from the HATCI vehicle.
- The CAN logs extracted from the October 2026 bags. They carry latitude and
  longitude columns, so they are a GPS trace of that vehicle.
- The container image, 12 GB compressed.

